<title>USA: Lancaster, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross. [CORRECTED 23:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Lancaster, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross. [CORRECTED 23:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $2 million of Lancaster, N.Y., various purpose serial bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.0508 percent (Corrects net interest cost from 5.508 percent).</p>
</text>
